\details{
The installed file `DATA-SOURCES.md` is the authoritative package register.
It records, for every data object, the source, transformations, required
attribution, licence evidence, and release decision. Locate it with:

```r
system.file("DATA-SOURCES.md", package = "IdSS")
```

The register uses four status labels: cleared with attribution, cleared under
a restricted licence, hold pending permission, and remove/replace. A public
release should contain only cleared data.
